---
description: to install casks, use this rule to amend the configuration and launch the sync script
globs: darwin/flake.nix
alwaysApply: false
---
before installing, run `brew search <query>` to check all available packages.
in flake.nix there's the homebrew.casks section. add the provided cask (or ask for it, if it's not available) to the list, afterwards prompt to *run* (not a textblock, but the interactive terminal) the `darwin-rebuild switch` command to run sync